'''Yankee Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] added in [[Version 3.4 Update|Version 3.4]] and was created by a collaboration event between [[Kishidan Collaboration Event|Battle Cats and Kishidan]], this unit is a treasure drop in the Kishidan collaboration stages.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 167
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Yankee Cat
|name2 = Sukeban Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Sukeban Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
==='''Normal Form'''===
Very similar to [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Cat]] in terms of usage. Cheap and expendable, it can be summoned en masse to take hits in place of other, more important units. This meatshield role is quite valuable, if not for the wide selection of cats able to perform this role, usually with a lower cost and higher speed. Yankee Cat, however, can be used in [[Restriction Stage]]s that allow [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cats]] (such as [[Wrath of D-Cyclone (Insane)|Wrath of D-Cyclone]]), where there is considerably less competition. Even then, Yankee is still not one of the best options due to its higher cost.

==='''Evolved Form'''===
Sukeban Cat gains extra stats, however, this does not make her worth the cost increase, as her health still remains very low and even irrelevant in [[Uncanny Legends]] and other late parts of the game. Because of this, the Normal Form should always be used over the Evolved Form.

{{Job|Classification = Meatshield}}

